## Visual Design Grid

| Element        | Concept              | Description                                                                 |
|:---------------|:---------------------|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Sidebar**    | The Dashboard        | Dark background with a glowing magenta grid. Fonts look like digital displays. |
| **Email Cards** | Data Cassettes       | Each email is a sleek card with sender's name and subject. Unread cards glow. |
| **Compose**    | The Mixing Board     | A dark editor with neon accents. Subject line = track title.                 |
| **Stickers**   | VHS Glitches         | Inserting a sticker looks like a chromatic aberration effect or tape static. |

---

## Micro-interactions Grid

| Action         | Sound / Effect       | Trigger Context                          |
|:---------------|:---------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| Reading        | VHS click            | Like a tape deck engaging                |
| Replying       | Synth blip           | Like a synthesizer note                  |
| Deleting       | Static hiss          | Like tape erasure                        |
| Searching      | Radar ping           | Like a sonar lock                        |
| Composing      | Keyboard clack       | Like a mechanical typewriter             |
| Loading        | Progress bar         | Fills like a fuel gauge                  |

> All sounds default to **off**, toggleable in Settings → Audio.
> Silent mode is the default for a reason: this is still an email client people use at work.

