## The One Rule

**Don't overdo the gamification.**
If reading an email requires too many interactions or animations, we lose the "works just as good as Proton" goal.
The synthwave metaphor stays *visual and occasional,* never *structural.*

---

## Why This Theme Works

| Principle        | Reasoning                                                              |
|:-----------------|:-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Nostalgia**    | Taps into the "retro" gaming crowd who grew up with 80s/90s tech.      |
| **Privacy Vibe** | The "night drive" and "underground" aesthetic feels secretive and cool. |
| **Distinctive**  | Very different from the other themes, giving users a strong aesthetic choice. |
| **Gamer-Coded**  | Synthwave is a massive aesthetic in gaming (soundtracks, UIs, character designs). |

